\fs24 \cf0 Project:
\f0\b0  Enterprise Self-Healing GitOps Platform on AWS EKS\

\f1\b Project Overview
\f0\b0 \
"I worked on building a production-grade Kubernetes platform on AWS using Amazon EKS. The objective was to automate the entire software delivery lifecycle\'97from code commit to production deployment\'97while ensuring security, scalability, observability, and self-healing. We followed GitOps principles with ArgoCD, CI using GitHub Actions, containerized applications with Docker, monitored the platform using Prometheus and Grafana, centralized logs, and implemented automated scaling and recovery mechanisms."\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

