\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 Challenges & Solutions \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Challenge:
\f0\b0  Manual deployments caused configuration drift.\

\f1\b Solution:
\f0\b0  Adopted GitOps with ArgoCD so Git became the single source of truth.\

\f1\b Challenge:
\f0\b0  Traffic was reaching Pods before the application finished starting.\

\f1\b Solution:
\f0\b0  Implemented startup and readiness probes.\

\f1\b Challenge:
\f0\b0  Traffic spikes caused high latency.\

\f1\b Solution:
\f0\b0  Configured HPA and Cluster Autoscaler.\

\f1\b Challenge:
\f0\b0  Production issues were detected late.\

\f1\b Solution:
\f0\b0  Built dashboards and proactive alerts with Prometheus, Grafana, and AlertManager.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
