\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 "This project gave us an end-to-end automated delivery platform. Developers only needed to commit code. GitHub Actions handled validation and image creation, ArgoCD synchronized Kubernetes manifests, Amazon EKS hosted the workloads, Kubernetes provided self-healing and scaling, and Prometheus with Grafana delivered complete observability. By combining CI/CD, GitOps, infrastructure as code, and monitoring, we built a platform that was reliable, repeatable, and easier to operate in production."\
